    Registry -->|HarnessSpec + Providers| Harness[UC ProviderHarness]:::uc
    Registry -->|A2A endpoint| A2A[UC A2AWorkerService/<br/>A2AWorkerEndpoint]:::uc
    Factory --> A2A
    Harness --> Session[UC SharedSession/<br/>SessionProvider]:::uc
    Session --> SQLite[(SQLite<br/>shared_sessions)]:::storage
    API --> SQLite
    Manager --> SQLite
    Events --> SQLite
    Harness --> Runtime[Runtime adapter]:::uc
    Runtime --> LLM[OpenAI-compatible LLM]:::external
    Runtime --> MCP[MCP Server<br/>tools/list / tools/call]:::external